[{"title":"自兖放还","author":"刘奉世","text":"年来策蹇胜乘舟，楚塞齐边春复秋。\n不教微生同腐草，青山依旧水西流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34102,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郓州","author":"刘奉世","text":"暮舂朝城粟，晓采观城葑。\n一入高鱼境，已是武阳东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34103,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蔡州道中","author":"刘奉世","text":"黄河西渡出平沙，汝颍东流千里遐。\n给饷当年秦令史，封侯不种青门瓜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34104,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入直","author":"刘奉世","text":"玉烛含辉望处遐，禁钟动后起雌鸦。\n天高秘省云偏重，地迥琼林月半斜。\n三古文章留大史，百年事业照东华。\n时挥子墨随班马，芝检初分宰相麻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34105,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"还秩","author":"刘奉世","text":"微臣多忝窃，草莽愧荣褒。\n览镜怜衰白，衔环刷羽毛。\n贾生馀旧策，汉室尚东劳。\n俯伏闻纶綍，柴门日月高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34106,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"驾幸太学","author":"刘奉世","text":"圣典垂精及表章，旷仪亲举自宗庠。\n纵观桥拥浮云盖，侍问庭充振鹭行。\n首举儒风隆上国，光增帝业掩前王。\n太平荣遇惭多幸，重见歌虞起庙堂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34107,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送程给事知越州","author":"刘奉世","text":"使君遗爱遍南州，五马新归瘴海头。\n持橐未厌青琐直，怀章还作鉴湖游。\n姚馀人物传吴远，越绝山川向剡幽。\n应有清诗资卧理，会吟他日记风流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34108,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九河叹","author":"刘奉世","text":"冀东皆禹迹，渐海观朝宗。\n河阴渐沦没，平沙荡无踪。\n汉武筑宣房，作歌称成功。\n今塞商胡口，清流不时通。\n何当洒二渠，载跨碣石东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34109,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自述","author":"刘奉世","text":"楚国中分后，东南世泽长。\n发祥曾王父，磨勘成典章。\n王父声益振，主客尚书郎。\n考庙绪丕显，直鲠在岩廊。\n历历一精白，敬事持人纲。\n顾维予小子，念释兹勿忘。\n晴空丽皎日，清秋凛严霜。\n金石磨不磷，松柏寒逾芳。\n旦评犹足信，清议讵虚张。\n梦寐滋洗涤，俯仰随否臧。\n所值匪所思，盈亏理有常。\n亨途无诡遇，偃蹇嘶骊黄。\n谁能饵大药，百年身平康。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34110,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过都","author":"刘奉世","text":"嵩高丽中华，岳色连瑶岛。\n上清神仙宫，庄严绝雕巧。\n浮云荡繁阴，变幻入冥眇。\n飘摇逾岩岑，淫翳混鸿灏。\n纵有景庆合，闇然蔽昏晓。\n况复浓雾生，一气成有昊。\n茫茫世宙间，落落耿孤抱。\n天意不可知，烦心惄焉捣。\n安得嘘大风，八方净如扫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34111,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨白花","author":"刘奉世","text":"春风吹百花，杨花飞恼人。\n谁家芍药殿春后，花飞杨柳空暮春。\n春来复春去，春去又春来。\n阳阿歌白雪，落絮欲成灰。\n花若有情风引去，拂郎征衣点归路。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34112,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郴州","author":"刘奉世","text":"当年贾傅去长沙，吊屈无灵赋楚些。\n万里不忘宣室夜，未舒三策不成家。\n西去潇湘南岳麓，名城叠叠纡盘谷。\n岣嵝不厌百回读，依然称是刘光禄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34113,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"检书","author":"刘奉世","text":"朗日照疏棂，临风事幽讨。\n药栏红欲翻，苔砌绿初扫。\n谁令墨王仙，肯使鱼子老。\n悠然天禄阁，世世以为宝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34114,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"刘奉世","text":"鹦鹉有客吊芳草，黄鹤无人吹落梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34115,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题饶州酒务厅屏","author":"刘季孙","text":"呢喃燕子语梁间，底事来惊梦里闲。\n说与傍人应不解，仗藜携酒看芝山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34116,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿巩守","author":"刘季裴","text":"正月从来号履端，那堪生日遇天官。\n万寻山岳才名重，千里江湖德量宽。\n菩萨像前开锦绣，老人星下爇旃檀。\n区区祝颂无他意，愿见灵椿度岁寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34117,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿朱守","author":"刘季裴","text":"康鼎谈经世少双，一时文物动虞庠。\n江湖虽隔金闺籍，衣袖仍闻玉案香。\n墨客几年陪画隼，板舆平日到萱堂。\n时清身健堪行乐，未见荆榛老凤凰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34118,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月丹","author":"施枢","text":"灵种飞来鹤顶红，谁云九转有仙功。\n广庭曾侍东风宴，留得霞杯照晚丛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34119,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"田家 其一","author":"刘学箕","text":"稻熟田间笑老农，鼕鼕村鼓乐时丰。\n新篘自酌花瓷椀，醉倒扶携夕照中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34120,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再次叔通来字诗字韵二首 其二","author":"刘学箕","text":"谁念溪翁我念之，折腰为米见诸诗。\n春秧夏穟苦萦抱，不似东坡更似谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34121,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再次叔通来字诗字韵二首 其一","author":"刘学箕","text":"秋云冥冥未开霁，搔首怀人人未来。\n特地送将双鲤去，果然换得两诗回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34122,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次叔通推官见寄二首 其二","author":"刘学箕","text":"君比昌黎颇似之，号啼不问但吟诗。\n贮储甚愧邻僧谊，不与卢仝更与谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34123,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次叔通推官见寄二首 其一","author":"刘学箕","text":"海错园蔬富矣哉，杜醪龙婿一时来。\n放杯停箸情何似，经造无何半日回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34124,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池萍 其三","author":"刘学箕","text":"风标漫与万花殊，可有尘埃染得渠。\n把住琼枝相晤语，只疑身在玉堂居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34125,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池萍 其一","author":"刘学箕","text":"一番雨过一番多，间挟晴风涨绿波。\n柳絮吹残游迹在，谢池点点是阳和。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34126,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"池萍 其二","author":"刘学箕","text":"竹篱茅舍去相安，谁与移根入画栏。\n尽道重帘妨暖日，疏枝却得护春寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34127,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西岩观瀑水简沈庄仲三首 其三","author":"刘学箕","text":"暮云新月一钩镰，归路溪风动碧蒹。\n美酒不妨车后载，夜深无处认青帘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34128,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西岩观瀑水简沈庄仲三首 其二","author":"刘学箕","text":"踏石穿云野兴添，傍崖昌歜绿纤纤。\n幽人近得安心术，撷满湘篮意未厌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34129,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西岩观瀑水简沈庄仲三首 其一","author":"刘学箕","text":"云润衣裾夕露沾，悬崖一水散疏帘。\n精庐隐约青山下，缥缈飞甍出画檐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34130,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伯益以玉舟相酬酢席上口占二绝 其二","author":"刘学箕","text":"元正讲礼讵能忘，便辱留连设酒浆。\n笑指一船春盎盎，稽山应未愧知章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34131,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伯益以玉舟相酬酢席上口占二绝 其一","author":"刘学箕","text":"新年殊未有吟搜，美酒醺人不自由。\n多谢主人情意厚，玉舟三度转船头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34132,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余读林子仁诗云君心恨不走天涯不比衰翁只恋家最是横塘黄叶路今年无伴折梅花时吟此诗念刘伯益之未返偶检校前村南枝的皪已三花五蕊矣忽伯益自黄檗归访余折归插玩知友朋之念有同然者对花剧饮用韵述怀","author":"刘学箕","text":"梅边春兴浩无涯，长忆西湖处士家。\n我政念君君过我，夜窗同共醉疏花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34133,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴山雪霁","author":"刘学箕","text":"九天宫阙春风满，陆地楼台夜月寒。\n铁笛一声吹雁落，片云不到玉栏干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34134,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"妙湛寺","author":"刘学箕","text":"山径盘纡露石根，一溪流水两山云。\n斋馀缓步青松下，输与萧閒老惠勤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34135,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"净口二绝句 其二","author":"刘学箕","text":"修修野竹碧琅玕，乱石悬崖剑戟攒。\n贪看野禽穿绿树，不知船已过前滩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34136,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"净口二绝句 其一","author":"刘学箕","text":"一江春水绿油油，绕尽春山去不休。\n愧我虚舟无定著，追随曲折与同流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34137,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张政仲见寄三绝 其一","author":"刘学箕","text":"柘山尽处即屏山，若隔蓬莱弱水间。\n伐木歌馀凝望远，此心翻羡白云閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34138,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张政仲见寄三绝 其二","author":"刘学箕","text":"故人别去复一月，三绝诗章寄我来。\n我有青州四从事，已令挈至待君开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34139,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张政仲见寄三绝 其三","author":"刘学箕","text":"药畦菜圃足秋雨，菊径松坡未就荒。\n请命当年嵇吕驾，便同看剑引杯长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34140,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝际窗前睡香","author":"施枢","text":"瑞锦窠应对锦郎，谁将灵种到幽坊。\n山深月冷梅花老，压尽群英是此香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34141,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中用雪坡韵","author":"施枢","text":"无计酬春独有诗，倚栏终日候晴晖。\n东风渐属新桃李，帘幕深深燕子飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34142,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"侵晓书怀四绝句 其三","author":"刘学箕","text":"披衣启外户，晨光清可挹。\n绿树閟苍烟，遥认枫叶赤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","